      "$comment": "M02h5: the vegetation scatter on the client (chunks/vegetation-pool.ts). Within tree.drawM every tree draws once: as a mesh inside impostorM (per mesher profile, 10 % hysteresis), else as an opaque camera-facing impostor card (chunks/impostors.ts); shrubs and hedges within shrubDrawM. Instances are re-banded after rebandM of camera travel or when a unit lands, crossing units only, at most writeCap instance writes per frame (counted against the tier's upload cap). Thinning keeps a scatter record (bit 7 of the TREE byte) when its positional hash is below scatterKeep (trees) or shrubKeep (shrubs and hedges) of the look profile; street trees are never thinned. Design values.",
